# ── YOUR FINANCIAL DATA — never commit this ───────────────────────────────
# finplan_data.json holds every transaction, balance, account number fragment
# and note you have entered. Git keeps history forever, so a single accidental
# commit is not undone by deleting the file later.
finplan_data.json
finplan_data.json.bak
finplan_data.json.broken
finplan_data.json.tmp

